OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786569552
OL,3,CEurovision changes rules so winners in
OL,4,C'armed conflict' can't host contest
OL,6,FThe Eurovision Song Contest has
OL,7,Fchanged its rules so that the next
OL,8,Fwinner will be automatically
OL,9,Fineligible to host the following year
OL,10,Fif their state is involved in an
OL,11,F"armed conflict" or "sensitive
OL,12,Fgeopolitical situation".
OL,14,FA country will also be ineligible to
OL,15,Fhost if "any other situation
OL,16,Fmaterially affects the security,
OL,17,Fsafety or stability of their state or
OL,18,Fimmediate region", the contest said in
OL,19,Fa statement on Wednesday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
