OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786569552
OL,3,CEurovision changes rules so winners in
OL,4,C'armed conflict' can't host contest
OL,6,FThe new rules mean the European
OL,7,FBroadcasting Union (EBU), who organise
OL,8,Fthe annual event, could commission an
OL,9,Findependent security assessment into a
OL,10,Fwinner's region if necessary.
OL,12,F"If the winning Member is deemed
OL,13,Funable to host, the EBU will identify
OL,14,Fan alternative Host Broadcaster," the
OL,15,Fstatement said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
