FL,307,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786569552
OL,3,CEurovision changes rules so winners in
OL,4,C'armed conflict' can't host contest
OL,6,FThe changes were made following
OL,7,Ffeedback from participating
OL,8,Fbroadcasters in this year's contest,
OL,9,Fand are designed to provide greater
OL,10,Fclarity for artists and production
OL,11,Fstaff, according to the EBU.
OL,13,FSpain, the Netherlands, Ireland and
OL,14,FSlovenia all boycotted this year's
OL,15,FEurovision over Israel's inclusion
OL,16,Famid the war in Gaza.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
