PN,30604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786569552
OL,3,CEurovision changes rules so winners in
OL,4,C'armed conflict' can't host contest
OL,6,FOthers rules changed include the age
OL,7,Fof participants, with artists
OL,8,Frepresenting their country needing to
OL,9,Fnow be at least 18, rather than 16, on
OL,10,Fthe day of their first rehearsal.
OL,12,FThis adaptation is part of an effort
OL,13,Fto "strengthen safeguarding and
OL,14,Fprotect younger artists from the
OL,15,Fpressures associated with competing at
OL,16,Fthe Eurovision Song Contest",
OL,17,FEurovision said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
