CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786569552
OL,3,CEurovision changes rules so winners in
OL,4,C'armed conflict' can't host contest
OL,6,FThe news comes as part of the
OL,7,FEurovision Song Contest's annual rule
OL,8,Freview and also included clarification
OL,9,Faround audio rules.
OL,11,F"The core principle remains unchanged:
OL,12,Fthe Lead Singer(s) must perform the
OL,13,Fmain melody live", the statement said.
OL,15,F"Backing tracks and pre-recorded
OL,16,Felements may be used in accordance
OL,17,Fwith the Rules, but the lead vocal
OL,18,Fmust be the only element performing
OL,19,Fthe main melody and they cannot
OL,20,Freplace or unduly assist the live
OL,21,Fvocal performance."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
