OL,3,CEurovision changes rules so winners in
OL,4,C'armed conflict' can't host contest
OL,6,FSpeaking on the overall rule changes,
OL,7,FMartin Green CBE, director of the
OL,8,FEurovision Song Contest, said the
OL,9,Fannual review of the rules keeps the
OL,10,Fcompetition "fair, transparent and
OL,11,Fconsistent for all those who
OL,12,Fparticipate".
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
