PN,30607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786569552
OL,3,CEurovision changes rules so winners in
OL,4,C'armed conflict' can't host contest
OL,6,F"These changes are about giving
OL,7,Feveryone involved greater clarity,
OL,8,Fprotecting artists and ensuring the
OL,9,FContest continues to provide a safe
OL,10,Fand welcoming environment, while
OL,11,Fpreserving the spirit and integrity
OL,12,Fthat make the Eurovision Song Contest
OL,13,Fso special," Green said.
OL,15,FThe 2027 Eurovision Song Contest is
OL,16,Fset to be held in Bulgaria after
OL,17,Fsinger Dara won this year's event in
OL,18,FVienna, Austria, in May.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
