OL,3,CEurovision changes rules so winners in
OL,4,C'armed conflict' can't host contest
OL,6,FDespite protests ahead of and during
OL,7,Fthe event, Israel's Noam Bettan came
OL,8,Fin second place during the competition
OL,9,Fwith the song Michelle.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/8
